	(text "J14 crossing (D-122): each slow line from the controller board enters through a series link\n(0R fitted) with a capacitor footprint to GND (not fitted), placed at J14. Values are set on the bench:\nseries 100R to 1k, C up to 100 pF; check the I2C rise time with the 2.2k pull-ups (IO sheet).\nTest points on the logic side (D-120). Nets *_J run from J14 to this sheet only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
